## Branch: control

# Heading on survey screens 1 to 3 of a short in-product survey shown to new Firefox users. Keep it short: it sits on one line in a narrow panel.
nuts-title = Tell us about your Firefox experience
# Survey question. Keep the quoted statement close to the English meaning: Firefox keeps its privacy and security promises.
nuts-q-integrity = How much do you agree or disagree with the following statement? “Firefox follows through on the privacy and security promises it makes.”
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-strongly-disagree = Strongly disagree
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-disagree = Disagree
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-neither = Neither agree nor disagree
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-agree = Agree
# Answer option on a 5-point agree/disagree scale.
nuts-scale-strongly-agree = Strongly agree
# Button that moves to the next survey question.
nuts-next = Next
# Link to Mozilla's Firefox privacy notice.
nuts-privacy-notice = Privacy notice
# Survey question. Keep the quoted statement close to the English meaning: Firefox cares about the user, not only about making money.
nuts-q-benevolence = How much do you agree or disagree with the following statement? “Firefox has my best interests in mind, not just its own profit.”
# Survey question about the person's past use of Firefox.
nuts-q-tenure = Which of the following options best describes your past use of Firefox?
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-first-time = I recently started using Firefox for the first time
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-stopped-within-year = I used Firefox before, but stopped using it within the last year
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-stopped-over-year = I used Firefox before, but stopped using it more than a year ago
# Answer option describing how the person has used Firefox in the past.
nuts-tenure-current-reinstall = I already use Firefox and just installed (or re-installed) it on this device
# Button that submits the last survey answer.
nuts-submit = Submit
# Heading on the last screen of the survey.
nuts-thanks-title = Thank you!
# Thank-you message after the survey is submitted.
nuts-thanks-body = Thanks for sharing your feedback. It helps us make Firefox better.
